fang:line076","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line070","text":"　　其一曰：\"魴以千載饒幸，得備州民，遠隔江川，敬恪未顯，瞻望雲景，天實為之。精誠微薄，名位不昭，雖懷焦渴，曷緣見明?狐死首丘，人情戀本，而逼所制，奉覿禮違。每獨矯首西顧，未嘗不寤寐勞歎，展轉反側也。今因隙穴之際，得陳宿昔之志，非神啟之，豈能致此!不勝翹企，萬里托命。謹遣親人董岑、邵南等托叛奉箋。時事變故，列於別紙，惟明公君侯垂日月之光，照遠民之趣，永令歸命者有所戴賴。\"","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line070:m0007","start":7,"end":8,"surface":"魴","kind":"person","person_id":"iuc_mqu_3jm","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line070:m0138","start":138,"end":140,"surface":"董岑","kind":"person","person_id":"82e_ano_ou7","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line070:m0141","start":141,"end":143,"surface":"邵南","kind":"person","person_id":"593_m1a_78r","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"}],"annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":70,"last_line":70,"revision_id":2120830,"raw_start":5972,"raw_end":6167,"character_positions":[5980,5981,5982,5983,5984,5985,5986,5987,5988,5989,5990,5991,5992,5993,5994,5995,5996,5997,5998,5999,6000,6001,6002,6003,6004,6005,6006,6007,6008,6009,6010,6011,6012,6013,6014,6015,6016,6017,6018,6019,6020,6021,6022,6023,6024,6025,6026,6027,6028,6029,6030,6031,6032,6033,6034,6035,6036,6037,6038,6039,6040,6041,6042,6043,6044,6045,6046,6047,6048,6049,6050,6051,6052,6053,6054,6055,6056,6057,6058,6059,6060,6061,6062,6063,6064,6065,6066,6067,6068,6069,6070,6071,6072,6073,6074,6075,6076,6077,6078,6079,6080,6081,6082,6083,6084,6085,6086,6087,6088,6089,6090,6091,6092,6093,6094,6095,6096,6097,6098,6099,6100,6101,6102,6103,6104,6105,6106,6107,6108,6109,6110,6111,6112,6113,6114,6115,6116,6117,6118,6119,6120,6121,6122,6123,6124,6125,6126,6127,6128,6129,6130,6131,6132,6133,6134,6135,6136,6137,6138,6139,6140,6141,6142,6143,6144,6145,6146,6147,6148,6149,6150,6151,6152,6153,6154,6155,6156,6157,6158,6159,6160,6161,6162,6163,6164,6165,6166]},"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-060","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line076","text":"　　其四曰：\"所遣董岑、邵南少長家門。親之信之，有如兒子。是以特令賫箋，托叛為辭，目語心計，不宣唇齒，骨肉至親，無有知者。又已敕之，到州當言往降，欲北叛來者得傳之也。魴建此計，任之於天，若其濟也，則有生全之福。邂逅洩漏，則受夷滅之禍。常中夜仰天，告誓星辰。精成之微，豈能上感，然事急孤窮，惟天是訴耳。遣使之日，載生載死，形存氣亡，魄爽恍惚。私恐使君未深保明，岑、南二人可留其一，以為後信。一賫教還，教還故當言悔叛還首。東主有常科，悔叛還者，皆自原罪。如是彼此俱塞，永無端原。縣命西望，涕筆俱下。\"","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line076:m0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"董岑","kind":"person","person_id":"82e_ano_ou7","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line076:m0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"邵南","kind":"person","person_id":"593_m1a_78r","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line076:m0083","start":83,"end":84,"surface":"魴","kind":"person","person_id":"iuc_mqu_3jm","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line076:m0179","start":179,"end":180,"surface":"岑","kind":"person","person_id":"82e_ano_ou7","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line076:m0181","surface":"南","start":181,"end":182,"kind":"person","person_id":"593_m1a_78r","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本段具名及前後親稱、官職定位。"}],"annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":76,"last_line":76,"revision_id":2120830,"raw_start":6875,"raw_end":7123,"character_positions":[6875,6876,6877,6878,6879,6880,6881,6882,6883,6884,6885,6886,6887,6888,6889,6890,6891,6892,6893,6894,6895,6896,6897,68